/P 70 0 R
/E (	In modern urban environments, traditional e-commerce systems are often built using monolithic architectures, which makes them difficult to scale, maintain, and secure. As user demand increases, these systems face performance bottlenecks, limited flexibility, and higher downtime risks. Additionally, lack of proper monitoring and security mechanisms leads to vulnerabilities, data breaches, and inefficient resource utilization. There is a need for a scalable, secure, and efficient cloud-based solution that can handle dynamic workloads while ensuring reliability, modularity, and real-time monitoring.)
