/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 71 0 R
/E (	This project presents a Cloud-Native Microservices E-Commerce Platform designed using containerization and modern DevOps practices. The system is divided into independent microservices such as user-service, product-service, order-service, and an API gateway, enabling scalability and flexibility. Docker is used for containerization, and Docker Compose is used to orchestrate multiple services efficiently. The platform ensures better resource utilization, security, and monitoring capabilities. By adopting microservices architecture and cloud-native principles, the system provides improved performance, fault isolation, and easy deployment, making it suitable for real-world scalable applications.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
